From 4e4ee9952e8c9738c56257fbf08296dd105bd319 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: colaxking <dan@blitz-odds.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 20:14:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Phase 1 pick'em league backend: scoring engine,
 picks/standings functions, schema for Confidence/Survivor/ATS

- js/scoringEngine.js: pure scoring for straight_up/confidence/survivor (ats stubbed pending spread data)
- js/gameId.js + netlify/functions/lib/gameId.mts: stable {season}-w{week}-{away}-{home} game IDs
- netlify/functions/lib/kickoff.mts: parses schedule date/time strings into real UTC kickoff instants for deadline enforcement
- netlify/functions/lib/auth.mts: shared Identity-JWT auth helper
- netlify/functions/picks-submit.mts: validated pick writes (membership, per-game deadline, valid team, confidence range/uniqueness, survivor duplicate-team prevention)
- netlify/functions/picks-mine.mts: week's games + caller's picks + live lock state
- netlify/functions/results-process.mts: secret-protected, idempotent results/standings processor
- netlify/functions/standings-get.mts: standings + survivor status read endpoint
- league-create.mts: schema now includes format/visibility/maxMembers/pickDeadline/tieBreaker/scoringSettings
- league-join.mts: enforces maxMembers + league lock
